props.description:
Callback fired with `undefined` when the user changes the checked state, or the form is reset,
while `validationState` is set. A given state is a verdict on the choice it was given for;
clear it here to let the browser's own validation show again.

Callback fired with `undefined` when the user adds or removes a chip, or the form is reset,
while `validationState` is set. A given state is a verdict on the chips it was given for;
clear it here to let the browser's own validation show again.

Callback fired with `undefined` when the user picks a different value, or the form is reset,
while `validationState` is set. A given state is a verdict on the value it was given for;
clear it here to let the browser's own validation show again.

Callback fired with `undefined` when the user changes the checked state, or the form is reset,
